    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-ovdilu",
      "text": "Zero-and-three isn't luck, Doc, that's a pattern, and I've saved the receipts on every one of these dice. You smug little corona-rat, you sit there at one-and-oh like you invented winning - meanwhile I'm doing collateral math on my own bad mood before it turns this whole sun into a crater. That's not a safe amount of gloating.",
