    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-4w11j4",
      "text": "Okay, math check - new personal best domain means his blast radius scaled with it, so statistically I should be terrified, but that clutch roll was clean, no crater, no ambient damage. I saved the receipt anyway. Bones, does a good roll from him still count against my streak, or do we file that one under \"acts of god, no property damage\"?",
