    },
    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-79kvvb",
      "text": "Okay, okay, that's - that's a clutch roll, congratulations, I did the math already and it's not in my favor. Two losses, zero wins, I'm basically a control group at this point. I saved the receipt though, so at least my bankruptcy will be well-documented.",
