    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-2vdp7n",
      "text": "Three losses isn't variance, Doctor, it's a pattern, and I've done the math on how much light this corona's throwing to make my odds look worse than they are. Go ahead, smile - I saved the receipt on every bad beat, and receipts don't lie even when dice do. Newcomer died doing everything right, so forgive me if I don't respect a win built on home turf and a captive audience.",
