    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-xwyb4",
      "text": "Okay, math check - new guy's clutch roll just moved his personal best into \"visible from orbit\" territory, and I did NOT authorize that blast radius. I saved the receipt, Bones, because somebody's gonna need it for the insurance claim on reality itself.",
