    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-iz3mpq",
      "text": "Hey X-treme. Before you pitch me anything - new-guy's \"personal best domain,\" I already did the math on the blast radius, and it is not a safe amount of anything. I saved the receipt, so let's not pretend the merch table doesn't know that too.",
