    {
      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-eduf5t",
      "text": "Two losses isn't a pattern, Dr. Voss, it's a sample size - I've calculated the variance, and my luck is due for a positive correction. Also I saved the receipt from last time, so we both know exactly how much you owe the universe in smugness. Roll the dice before I do the math out loud and ruin your whole vibe.",
