      "id": "cb-mr-kevin-aseqkd",
      "text": "Keith. Four and one, hot streak, you're basically a controlled burn right now - I respect that. Me, I'm 2-6, which is its own kind of consistency, and I saved the receipts for every one of those losses in case anyone asks what a slow-motion collapse looks like on paper.",
